<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan money markets close for holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan money markets close for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's money markets will be closed on Friday and Saturday for domestic holidays.</p>
<p>The markets will reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>On Thursday, the overnight interbank rate ended at 4.653 percent against 4.683 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
